<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>End-to-end evaluation experiments.</h2>

<figure id="A1.F13" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F13.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 13</span>. </span><span id="A1.F13.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Reconfiguration delay is <math id="A1.F13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10\mu{}s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">μ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10\mu{}s</annotation></semantics></math>. Training throughput of Bert Transformer on 32, 64 and 128 GPUs (HC=Grid).</span></figcaption><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.15450v1/bert_combined_relative_throughput_comparison_10micros.svg" id="A1.F13.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/78;" width="476" height="78"></object>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F14" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F14.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 14</span>. </span><span id="A1.F14.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Reconfiguration delay is <math id="A1.F14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25\mu{}s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">25</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">μ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25\mu{}s</annotation></semantics></math>. Training throughput of Bert Transformer on 32, 64 and 128 GPUs (HC=Grid).</span></figcaption><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.15450v1/bert_combined_relative_throughput_comparison_25micros.svg" id="A1.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/78;" width="476" height="78"></object>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F15" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F15.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 15</span>. </span><span id="A1.F15.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Reconfiguration delay is <math id="A1.F15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="50\mu{}s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">50</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">μ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">50\mu{}s</annotation></semantics></math>. Training throughput of Bert Transformer on 32, 64 and 128 GPUs (HC=Grid).</span></figcaption><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.15450v1/bert_combined_relative_throughput_comparison_50micros.svg" id="A1.F15.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/79;" width="476" height="79"></object>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F16" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F16.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 16</span>. </span><span id="A1.F16.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Reconfiguration delay is <math id="A1.F16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="500\mu{}s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">500</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">μ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">500\mu{}s</annotation></semantics></math>. Training throughput of Bert Transformer on 32, 64 and 128 GPUs (HC=Grid).</span></figcaption><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.15450v1/bert_combined_relative_throughput_comparison_500micros.svg" id="A1.F16.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/79;" width="476" height="79"></object>
</figure>
<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Figures </span><a href="#A1.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix A End-to-end evaluation experiments. ‣ PCCL: Photonic circuit-switched collective communication for distributed ML" class="ltx_ref" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a><span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, </span><a href="#A1.F14" title="Figure 14 ‣ Appendix A End-to-end evaluation experiments. ‣ PCCL: Photonic circuit-switched collective communication for distributed ML" class="ltx_ref" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a><span id="A1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">,</span><a href="#A1.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Appendix A End-to-end evaluation experiments. ‣ PCCL: Photonic circuit-switched collective communication for distributed ML" class="ltx_ref" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a><span id="A1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">,</span><a href="#A1.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ Appendix A End-to-end evaluation experiments. ‣ PCCL: Photonic circuit-switched collective communication for distributed ML" class="ltx_ref" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a><span id="A1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> show the performance of </span><span id="A1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">PCCL</span><span id="A1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> when the optical reconfiguration delay is 10, 25, 50 and 500</span><math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mu s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">μ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mu s</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> respectively. As the reconfiguration delay increases, the gap between the theoretical optimal performance and </span><span id="A1.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">PCCL</span><span id="A1.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">’s performance increases since </span><span id="A1.p1.1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">PCCL</span><span id="A1.p1.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> is forced to pay higher reconfiguration costs or congestion/dilation costs depending on which of the two leads to a lower collective runtime. Instead of always incurring a high reconfiguring cost, </span><span id="A1.p1.1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">PCCL</span><span id="A1.p1.1.14" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> intelligently trades off congestion/dilation for reconfiguration delay whenever it leads to a lower collective runtime.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Circuits without overlaps</h2>

<figure id="alg3" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> Mesh Routing with Edge Reuse Constraint</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg3.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G=(V,E)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">G</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">V</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">,</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">E</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G=(V,E)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, pairs, MAX_OVERLAP, PENALIZE_FACTOR
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l2.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">routes, edge_counts
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l3.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Initialize edge weights </span><math id="alg3.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">←</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l3.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, edge_counts </span><math id="alg3.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">←</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg3.l3.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg3.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
