</span>
</span></span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="alg4.5" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="alg4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Minimize:</span><span id="alg4.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><math id="alg4.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg4.5.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:10.0pt;"><span id="alg4.5.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span><span id="alg4.5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">subject to</span><span id="alg4.5.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.8pt;"><span id="alg4.5.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span>
